"Définissez les critères de conformité à l’aide d’expressions CEL.\n"
"Exemples :\n"
"- age_years(me.birthdate) >= 60\n"
"- me.gender == 'female' and age_years(me.birthdate) >= 18\n"
"- members.exists(m, age_years(m.birthdate) < 5)"

#. module: spp_programs
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spp_programs.field_spp_program_create_wizard__compliance_cel_expression
